], "widgets_values": [1472, 1104, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 31, "type": "EmptySD3LatentImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "widget_ue_connectable": {"batch_size": true, "width": true, "height": true}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptySD3LatentImage"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [25], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [480, 590], "pos": [381.8359069824219, 900.2970581054688], "widgets_values": ["Core Story: After a \"singularity event\", in an abandoned subway station that was flooded, a cyborg monk meticulously cares for a self-luminous botanical garden created through gene editing.\nPrompt: A surreal rendering image in the \"Wabi-Sabi Cyberpunk\" style. In the center of the scene, an elderly monk wearing a traditional monk robe is seated cross-legged on an abandoned subway carriage that is partially submerged in clear water. His arms are semi-transparent prosthetics, with intricate fluorescent fibers visible like meridians. The entire carriage and platform are occupied by a bizarre ecosystem: huge mushrooms emitting a soft blue-purple light grow from the walls, the ground is covered with breathing moss that pulsates in light and shade, and several \"data water lilies\" suspended in the air are slowly opening and closing. Several mechanical koi fish with LED circuit patterns swim gracefully in the water. The monk is using a laser scalpel to carefully trim the branches and leaves of a fluorescent plant. The entire scene is illuminated entirely by these biological light sources without external light sources, creating a dreamlike volumetric light effect. The light produces complex ray-tracing reflections on the water surface, giving the image both the serenity and decaying beauty of the apocalypse and a sense of advanced technology and vitality."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 30, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Prompt", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.5.1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 12}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-517.3925502432302, -821.5205010676943], "scale": 0.6830134553650712}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Step 1 - Upload models", "bounding": [1671.46923828125, 963.6588745117188, 318.18182373046875, 416.0299072265625]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "Custom sampler", "bounding": [2481.46923828125, 963.6588745117188, 558.535888671875, 501.6000061035156]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "Step 4- Image size", "bounding": [2481.46923828125, 1483.6588134765625, 560, 285.6000061035156]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "Step2 - Prompt", "bounding": [2011.46923828125, 963.6588745117188, 450, 420]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "Step 3- Reference images", "bounding": [1671.46923828125, 1403.6588134765625, 790, 700]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 6, "title": "Ctrl-B to Enable", "bounding": [2011.46923828125, 773.6588745117188, 450, 1